<title>HONG KONG: Soundwill announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Soundwill announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	     14.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    nil</p>
<p>    Net				129.46</p>
<p>    Turnover			 670.61</p>
<p>    Company name		   Soundwill Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    June 16-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Property redevelopment firm Soundwill Holdings was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on March 21.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one 1999 warrant for every 10 shares held. Each unit of warrant will entitle the holder to subscribe for one share at an initial subscription price of HK$3.45 per share (subject to adjustment) during the period from June 27, 1997, to June 26, 1999.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
